"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108778","id":3094664787,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64dNZT","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-20T17:30:15Z","updated_at":"2025-07-20T17:30:15Z","body":"> In addition, sometimes pressing down or up arrow skips to a seemingly random option within the menus. This is often after one switches menus, e.g., from the menu containing options for things like project settings back to one containing the new scene option. Pressing down arrow at this point often snaps one to 8th, 12th, 17th option with no rhyme or reason behind it. This behavior is inconsistent.\n\nI can also (rarely) reproduce the first arrow key press after opening a menu registering multiple times, this is definitely a bug.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094664787/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]